WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.080 --> 00:00:03.220
A tree has no heart and no pump.

2
00:00:03.270 --> 00:00:06.380
The pipes that carry its
water are dead cells:

3
00:00:06.430 --> 00:00:09.140
hollow tubes with nothing inside.

4
00:00:09.190 --> 00:00:12.590
Yet water climbs from the
roots to the highest leaves,

5
00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:15.470
and the tree spends no energy lifting it.

6
00:00:15.520 --> 00:00:19.290
So how does water reach the
top of the tallest tree,

7
00:00:19.340 --> 00:00:22.230
with no pump and no energy spent?

8
00:00:22.280 --> 00:00:25.190
In this mission, you'll
look inside a leaf,

9
00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:28.990
where tiny pores open to
let carbon dioxide in.

10
00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.130
Then you'll trace water's
whole path through a plant,

11
00:00:32.180 --> 00:00:34.500
from soil to open air.

12
00:00:34.550 --> 00:00:39.230
Your mission: find out how water
reaches the top of the tallest tree,

13
00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:41.720
with no pump and no energy spent.
